e daden opnieuw betekenis krijgen. De roman speelt in Wessex, een fictieve streek die sterk met het landelijke Engeland is verbonden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8193406W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801738113"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:00.000Z","reference":"work:1483","note":"Hardy MayorofCasterbridge. KB explicitly binds long bibliographic title to shortened front title; one novel, no duplicate Work. Exact current source-edition key is already present; fill its absent ISBN from bound independent KB records, never insert a duplicate edition. Only Pijpelijntjes additionally needs NULL-language→dut based on exact KB language evidence.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-026.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8193406W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801738113"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":6582601,"sha256":"efea9b4443c9fcfa3ebf2853c668309a6cc4966406faa297b20e280f60ead6d1","reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-003.jpg. Thomas Hardy; De burgemeester van Casterbridge; Kramers Klassieken. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-011"}},{"ref":"m4","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":1564},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":1564,"work_id":1483,"bound_author_id":240,"bound_title":"Leven en dood van de burgemeester van Casterbridge","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789027491190","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https